    "sources": [
      "Gutzmer J., Beukes N.J. & Cairncross B. (2004) — New interpretation of the origin of tiger's-eye: Comment. Geology 32(1):e44. DOI 10.1130/0091-7613-32.1.e44. Field transition from tiger's-eye through hawk's-eye to crocidolite and restriction to the shallow silicified/goethitized zone.",
      "Miyano T. & Klein C. (1983) — Evaluation of the Stability Relations of Amphibole Asbestos in Metamorphosed Iron-Formations. Mining Geology 33:213-222. DOI 10.11456/shigenchishitsu1951.33.213. Crocidolite/amosite stability and BIF assemblages at 150-450°C."
